  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5R6Vc7i.png\" alt=\"Title\"></p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/clear-weather\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-0C0D0F?logo=github&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fNotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--Fi-0C0D0F?logo=kofi&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://twitch.tv/NotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitch-0C0D0F?logo=twitch&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-0C0D0F?logo=discord&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p>🌧️ <strong>Clear Weather</strong> 是一款极简风格的资源包，降低了 Minecraft 中雨雪粒子的效果，提供更清晰、对码率更友好的体验。无论你是正在录制视频，还是只是厌倦了繁杂的视觉效果，这个资源包都能帮助你在暴风雨期间保持画面清晰，同时不会移除氛围效果。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ <strong>减少雨雪粒子</strong> – 恶劣天气下视觉更清爽。</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>面向主播</strong> – 帮助避免因密集粒子效果导致的码率问题。</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>轻量</strong> – 不提升纹理分辨率，无性能影响</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>高度兼容</strong> – 可与其他资源包配合使用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🖼️ 预览</h2>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogdgDEj.gif\" width=\"400\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z9slA5O.gif\" width=\"400\">\n<h2>💬 需要帮助？</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/clear-weather/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>Github</code></a> 或 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>Discord 服务器</code></a>！</p>",
